{
  "company_name": "FleetEdge Solutions",
  "industry": "Logistics",
  "use_case": "Fleet planning, vehicle allocation, and capacity optimization",
  "space_title": "FleetEdge Solutions - Fleet Planning & Optimization 🚚",
  "space_description": "**Subindustry:** Logistics\n\n**Use case:** Fleet Planning, Vehicle Allocation & Capacity Optimization\n\nFleetEdge Solutions — asset-level fleet analytics across 20 vehicles (Heavy Duty / Medium Duty / Light Duty / Sprinter) dispatched from 8 regional depots. Fleet Managers use this space for daily dispatch and utilization decisions; the S&OP Lead balances capacity to demand; the VP Logistics tracks OTD and dispatch failure rates; the CFO monitors revenue per asset, maintenance spend, and operating margin per vehicle class.\n\n**Key KPIs**\n- Asset utilization % — dispatched / available hours; industry target 70%+ for heavy duty\n- On-time delivery % — SLA performance; target 95%+\n- Revenue per vehicle (USD/month) — asset productivity metric\n- Cost per km (fuel + maintenance) — primary unit-cost lever\n- Maintenance cost as % of revenue — fleet health and aging signal\n- Idle hours — under-utilization indicator\n- Operation count — throughput per asset class\n- Delivery failure / partial rate — service quality red flag\n\n**Data sources**\n- `fleet_operations` — daily dispatch records: vehicle, depot, route distance, cargo, fuel, delivery status, revenue\n- `vehicle_utilization_snapshots` — weekly per-vehicle hours (available, dispatched, maintenance, idle) and odometer\n- `fleet_kpi_monthly` — monthly per-vehicle P&L: revenue, fuel cost, maintenance cost, distance, utilization, OTD",
  "schema_basename": "fleet_planning",
  "tables": [
    {
      "table_name": "fleet_operations",
      "description": "Daily fleet dispatch and operation records including vehicle assignments, routes, cargo, mileage, fuel usage, and delivery outcomes.",
