  "genie_instructions": "DOMAIN CONTEXT\nThis space supports fleet planning, vehicle allocation, and capacity optimization for a 3PL operating 20 vehicles across Heavy Duty, Medium Duty, Light Duty, and Sprinter classes from 8 regional depots. Stakeholders include the Fleet Manager (utilization, dispatch, maintenance), VP Logistics (OTD, delivery failures), S&OP Lead (capacity vs. demand), and CFO (revenue per asset, cost per km, margin by vehicle class).\n\nMETRIC DEFINITIONS\n- Asset utilization = utilization_pct = dispatched_hours / available_hours; heavy-duty target 70%+\n- On-time delivery rate = on_time_delivery_pct on fleet_kpi_monthly (or count of delivery_status='On Time' in fleet_operations); target 95%+\n- Revenue per vehicle = monthly_revenue_usd by vehicle_id\n- Cost per km = (monthly_fuel_cost_usd + monthly_maintenance_cost_usd) / total_distance_km; benchmark $0.60–$1.20 for heavy duty\n- Maintenance burden = monthly_maintenance_cost_usd / monthly_revenue_usd; >15% is aging-fleet warning\n- Idle ratio = idle_hours / available_hours; persistent >25% signals over-fleet exposure\n- Delivery failure / partial rate = share of fleet_operations.delivery_status in ('Failed','Partial')\n\nQUERY GUIDANCE\n- ALWAYS prefer metric views with MEASURE() syntax for aggregations.\n  - fleet_operations_metrics (source: fleet_operations) — dims: operation_date, vehicle_class, depot_code, delivery_status; measures: total_revenue_usd, total_fuel_consumed_liters, total_distance_km, total_cargo_weight_kg, operation_count, on_time_operation_count, unique_vehicle_count, max_route_distance_km.\n  - fleet_kpi_monthly_metrics (source: fleet_kpi_monthly) — dims: report_month, vehicle_class, vehicle_id; measures: total_monthly_revenue, total_monthly_fuel_cost, total_monthly_maintenance_cost, avg_utilization_pct, avg_on_time_delivery_pct, total_total_distance_km, max_monthly_revenue.\n- Use GROUP BY ALL with MEASURE() queries.\n- For monthly trends, always wrap the date in DATE_TRUNC('month', <date_col>).\n- For \"Top X\" requests, return LIMIT 10 unless the user specifies otherwise.\n- Query base tables directly only when needing columns not exposed by metric views (e.g. vehicle_name, available_hours, idle_hours, maintenance_hours, odometer_km).\n- When the user's phrasing matches a SQL snippet display name (filters, expressions, or measures), prefer that snippet.",
  "sample_questions": [
    "Show monthly total revenue and monthly fuel cost by vehicle class for the trailing 12 months.",
    "How has average utilization trended month-over-month across each vehicle class?",
    "Top 10 vehicles by monthly revenue last month, and what was each vehicle's maintenance cost?",
    "Which depots had the highest share of delivery_status = 'Failed' or 'Partial' operations this quarter?",
    "Top 10 vehicles by maintenance cost as a percent of revenue — which assets should we consider retiring?",
    "What is the total operation count and on-time operation count by depot for the last 90 days?",
    "Which vehicle class generated the highest revenue per kilometer in the most recent reporting month?"
  ],
  "example_sqls": [
    {
      "question": "How many distinct transactions appeared each month?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT DATE_TRUNC('month', operation_date) AS month, COUNT(DISTINCT transaction) AS distinct_count",
        "FROM {fqn}.fleet_operations",
        "GROUP BY 1",
        "ORDER BY 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has total total route distance in kilometers trended over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT operation_date, MEASURE(max_route_distance_km) AS max_route_distance_km",
        "FROM {fqn}.fleet_operations_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY operation_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has total monthly fuel cost trended over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT DATE_TRUNC('month', report_month) AS month, MEASURE(total_monthly_fuel_cost) AS total_monthly_fuel_cost",
        "FROM {fqn}.fleet_kpi_monthly_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY month"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has average on-time delivery percentage changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT report_month, MEASURE(avg_on_time_delivery_pct) AS avg_on_time_delivery_pct",
        "FROM {fqn}.fleet_kpi_monthly_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY report_month"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "Which vehicles have the highest total *?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT vehicle_name, SUM(*) AS record_count, SUM(route_distance_km) AS total_route_distance_km",
        "FROM {fqn}.fleet_operations",
        "WHERE delivery_status = 'Failed'",
        "GROUP BY vehicle_name",
        "ORDER BY total_route_distance_km DESC",
        "LIMIT 10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the trend of total hours vehicle was available for dispatch over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT snapshot_date, SUM(available_hours) AS total_available_hours",
        "FROM {fqn}.vehicle_utilization_snapshots",
        "GROUP BY snapshot_date ORDER BY snapshot_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has the average average utilization rate for the month changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT report_month, AVG(avg_utilization_pct) AS avg_avg_utilization_pct",
        "FROM {fqn}.fleet_kpi_monthly",
        "GROUP BY report_month ORDER BY report_month"
      ]
    }
  ],
